espix — a Unix(-like) runtime for ESP32.

  /bin    apps loaded by `run`
  /etc    configuration
  /home   your files
  /tmp    scratch, not cleared on boot yet
  /var    logs and state

This file lives on LittleFS, mounted as /. Edit it and it survives a reboot.
Build an app with apps/hello, drop it in /bin, and `run /bin/hello`.
